---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { CATEGORIES } from '../utils/categories.ts';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="关于"
  description="关于徐磊（LLLLei）：记录算法、开发与兴趣，也记录理解世界的方法。"
  image="/avatar-xulei.jpg"
>
  <section class="about container-wide">
    <header class="about-hero">
      <p class="folio">ABOUT / 002</p>
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="identity">
          <h1>你好，<br />我是 <em>徐磊</em>。</h1>
          <p class="hero-summary">一个持续学习、喜欢把问题拆开研究的人。网络上使用 <strong>LLLLei</strong> 这个名字写作。</p>
          <span class="identity-meta">XU LEI · BASED IN CHINA · WRITING ON THE WEB</span>
        </div>
        <figure class="portrait">
          <div class="portrait-frame">
            <img
              src="/avatar-xulei.jpg"
              width="1080"
              height="1080"
              alt="徐磊的手绘头像"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>
          <figcaption><span>SELF PORTRAIT / 2026</span><span>徐磊 · LLLLei</span></figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <aside class="about-index" aria-label="本页目录">
        <p>ON THIS PAGE</p>
        <ol>
          <li><a href="#intro">自我介绍</a></li>
          <li><a href="#topics">写作主题</a></li>
          <li><a href="#blog">关于博客</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contact">保持联系</a></li>
        </ol>
      </aside>

      <div class="about-content">
        <section id="intro" class="chapter intro">
          <p class="chapter-number">01</p>
          <div>
            <h2>在学习与创造之间，留下可复用的理解。</h2>
            <p class="intro-lead">我叫徐磊，网络上常用 LLLLei。我关注算法与程序设计，也对数学、音乐和游戏保持好奇。这个博客用来记录做项目时遇到的问题、竞赛中的思考，以及那些值得从“知道”走到“理解”的知识。</p>
            <p>我更在意一篇文章是否讲清了来龙去脉，而不是更新得有多快。如果这里的一张图、一段代码或一个解释帮你少走了一点弯路，它就完成了使命。</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="topics" class="chapter topics">
          <p class="chapter-number">02</p>
          <div>
            <h2>我在写什么</h2>
            <ol class="topic-list">
              {CATEGORIES.map((category, index) => (
                <li>
                  <a href={category.path}>
                    <span>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
                    <strong>{category.label}</strong>
                    <small>{category.description}</small>
                  </a>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ol>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="blog" class="chapter">
          <p class="chapter-number">03</p>
          <div>
            <h2>关于这个博客</h2>
            <p>站点使用 Astro 构建并部署在 GitHub Pages。它保持静态、轻量和可迁移：正文属于 Markdown，链接可以长期存在，阅读不依赖账号或复杂脚本。</p>
            <blockquote>
              <p>先理解，再表达；先对内容负责，再考虑发布频率。</p>
            </blockquote>
            <dl class="site-facts">
              <div><dt>作者</dt><dd>徐磊 · LLLLei</dd></div>
              <div><dt>始于</dt><dd>2026</dd></div>
              <div><dt>内容</dt><dd>原创笔记与项目记录</dd></div>
              <div><dt>技术</dt><dd>Astro · Markdown · GitHub Pages</dd></div>
              <div><dt>隐私</dt><dd>不公开设备与活动遥测</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="contact" class="chapter contact">
          <p class="chapter-number">04</p>
          <div>
            <h2>保持联系</h2>
            <p>如果你想讨论文章、项目或交换友链，可以从下面这些公开入口找到我。</p>
            <div class="contact-links">
              <a href="https://github.com/LLLLLei073" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
              <a href="/rss.xml">RSS 订阅 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
              <a href="/friends">友情链接 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-top: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
  }

  .about-hero {
    padding-bottom: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-foreground);
  }

  .folio,
  .about-index > p,
  .chapter-number {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(300px, 0.65fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    align-items: end;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .identity {
    padding-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .hero-grid h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 7vw, 7.25rem);
    line-height: 0.98;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }

  .hero-grid h1 em {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .hero-summary {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem) 0 1.5rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-size: clamp(0.98rem, 1.45vw, 1.12rem);
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .hero-summary strong {
    color: var(--foreground);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .identity-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.64rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .portrait {
    width: min(100%, 380px);
    margin: 0;
    justify-self: end;
  }

  .portrait-frame {
    position: relative;
    padding: clamp(0.65rem, 1.4vw, 0.95rem);
    background: #f8f6f2;
    border: 1px solid var(--card-foreground);
    box-shadow: 12px 12px 0 var(--accent);
  }

  .portrait-frame::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    right: -1px;
    bottom: -1px;
    width: 28%;
    height: 4px;
    background: var(--primary);
  }

  .portrait img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .portrait figcaption {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 0.85rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 220px minmax(0, 820px);
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem);
    padding-top: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  .about-index {
    position: sticky;
    top: calc(var(--header-height) + 2rem);
    align-self: start;
  }

  .about-index ol {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: section;
  }

  .about-index a {
    display: block;
    padding: 0.55rem 0;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .about-index a:hover {
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .chapter {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 0 0 clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--header-height) + 2rem);
  }

  .chapter + .chapter {
    padding-top: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .chapter h2 {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.65rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .chapter p {
    margin: 0 0 1.15rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .chapter .intro-lead {
    color: var(--foreground);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.16rem, 2vw, 1.4rem);
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .topic-list {
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--card-foreground);
  }

  .topic-list li {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .topic-list a {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2rem minmax(90px, 0.3fr) 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 1rem 0;
  }

  .topic-list span,
  .topic-list small {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .topic-list span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .topic-list strong {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    color: var(--card-foreground);
  }

  .chapter blockquote {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    padding: 1.4rem 1.6rem;
    border-left-width: 2px;
  }

  .chapter blockquote p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--foreground);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .site-facts {
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--card-foreground);
  }

  .site-facts div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 6rem 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .site-facts dt {
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }

  .site-facts dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }

  .contact-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
  }

  .contact-links a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    min-width: 160px;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 0 0.9rem;
    color: var(--foreground);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--card-foreground);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }

  .contact-links a:hover {
    color: var(--primary);
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .hero-grid,
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .portrait {
      width: min(100%, 320px);
      justify-self: start;
    }

    .about-index {
      position: static;
      display: none;
    }

    .about-content {
      max-width: 760px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about {
      padding: 3rem 1rem 4rem;
    }

    .hero-grid {
      margin-top: 1.8rem;
    }

    .portrait {
      width: min(78vw, 280px);
      justify-self: end;
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
    }

    .portrait figcaption {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.2rem;
    }

    .chapter {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.7rem;
    }

    .topic-list a {
      grid-template-columns: 2rem 1fr;
    }

    .topic-list small {
      grid-column: 2;
    }
  }
</style>
